1070
01:11:09,570 --> 01:11:12,774
<i>Six feet under</i>
<i>Getting under your skin</i>

1071
01:11:13,574 --> 01:11:16,911
<i>Cabin fever is a-setting in</i>

1072
01:11:16,944 --> 01:11:20,413
<i>You're stir crazy</i>
<i>Stuck in a rut</i>

1073
01:11:20,882 --> 01:11:23,751
<i>You could use</i>
<i>A little pick-me-up</i>

1074
01:11:24,552 --> 01:11:28,355
<i>I can give you</i>
<i>What it is you crave</i>

1075
01:11:28,388 --> 01:11:31,726
<i>A little something</i>
<i>From the good old days</i>

1076
01:11:31,759 --> 01:11:35,029
<i>I got the wind</i>
<i>Right here in a jar</i>

1077
01:11:35,663 --> 01:11:38,766
<i>I got the rain on tap</i>
<i>At the bar</i>

1078
01:11:38,800 --> 01:11:42,335
<i>I got sunshine</i>
<i>Up on a shelf</i>

1079
01:11:42,369 --> 01:11:46,073
<i>Allow me</i>
<i>To introduce myself</i>

1080
01:11:46,107 --> 01:11:48,743
<i>Brother, what's my name?</i>

1081
01:11:48,776 --> 01:11:50,443
<i>My name is</i>

1082
01:11:50,477 --> 01:11:53,380
<i>Our Lady of the Underground</i>

1083
01:11:53,413 --> 01:11:55,850
<i>Whoo!</i>
<i>Brother, what's my name?</i>

1084
01:11:55,883 --> 01:11:58,553
<i>Our lady of ways</i>

1085
01:11:58,586 --> 01:12:00,888
<i>Our lady of means</i>

1086
01:12:00,922 --> 01:12:03,558
<i>Brother, what's my name?</i>

1087
01:12:03,591 --> 01:12:05,126
<i>My name is</i>

1088
01:12:05,159 --> 01:12:08,029
<i>Our Lady of the Upside Down</i>

1089
01:12:08,863 --> 01:12:14,434
<i>Wanna know my name?</i>
<i>I'll tell you my name</i>

1090
01:12:14,467 --> 01:12:17,038
<i>Persephone!</i>

1091
01:12:17,071 --> 01:12:19,574
[audience cheering]

1092
01:12:30,651 --> 01:12:34,088
<i>Come here, brother</i>
<i>Let me guess</i>

1093
01:12:34,121 --> 01:12:37,792
<i>It's the little things you miss</i>

1094
01:12:37,825 --> 01:12:39,694
<i>Spring flowers</i>

1095
01:12:39,727 --> 01:12:41,629
<i>Autumn leaves</i>

1096
01:12:41,662 --> 01:12:44,932
<i>Ask me, brother</i>
<i>And you shall receive</i>

1097
01:12:44,966 --> 01:12:48,703
<i>Or maybe these</i>
<i>Just ain't enough</i>

1098
01:12:48,736 --> 01:12:51,839
<i>Maybe you're looking</i>
<i>For some stronger stuff</i>

1099
01:12:52,607 --> 01:12:55,743
<i>I got a sight</i>
<i>For the sorest eye</i>

1100
01:12:56,711 --> 01:12:59,379
<i>When was the last time</i>
<i>You saw the sky?</i>

1101
01:13:00,581 --> 01:13:04,118
<i>Wipe away your tears, brother</i>

1102
01:13:04,151 --> 01:13:07,922
<i>Brother, I know how you feel</i>

1103
01:13:07,955 --> 01:13:10,625
<i>I can see you're blinded</i>

1104
01:13:10,658 --> 01:13:13,961
<i>By the sadness of it all</i>

1105
01:13:15,129 --> 01:13:17,765
<i>But look a little closer</i>

1106
01:13:17,798 --> 01:13:22,737
<i>And everything will be revealed</i>

1107
01:13:22,770 --> 01:13:26,073
<i>Look a little closer and</i>

1108
01:13:27,808 --> 01:13:32,647
<i>There's a crack in the wall</i>

1109
01:13:36,651 --> 01:13:37,652
<i>Whoo!</i>

1110
01:13:45,159 --> 01:13:46,560
<i>Whoo!</i>

1111
01:13:47,561 --> 01:13:49,563
[trombone solo]

1112
01:13:59,106 --> 01:14:02,677
Ladies and gentlemen,
Daniel Higham, on the trombone!

1113
01:14:02,710 --> 01:14:04,645
[audience cheering]

1114
01:14:05,947 --> 01:14:09,482
David Kadumukasa on the cello!

1115
01:14:09,517 --> 01:14:11,719
[audience cheering]

1116
01:14:11,752 --> 01:14:13,821
Ros Stepen on the violin!

1117
01:14:13,854 --> 01:14:15,690
[audience cheering]

1118
01:14:15,723 --> 01:14:17,658
Brad Webb on drums!

1119
01:14:17,692 --> 01:14:20,027
[audience cheering]

1120
01:14:20,061 --> 01:14:21,562
Beth Symmons on the bass!

1121
01:14:21,595 --> 01:14:23,597
[audience cheering]

1122
01:14:23,631 --> 01:14:26,067
On the guitar, David Delarre!

1123
01:14:26,100 --> 01:14:28,035
[audience cheering]

1124
01:14:28,069 --> 01:14:30,771
And Tarek Merchant on the keys!

1125
01:14:30,805 --> 01:14:32,740
[audience cheering]

1126
01:14:33,708 --> 01:14:34,842
Whoo!

1127
01:14:45,553 --> 01:14:47,121
<i>You want stars?</i>

1128
01:14:47,154 --> 01:14:49,724
<i>I got a skyful</i>

1129
01:14:49,757 --> 01:14:52,994
<i>Put a quarter in the slot</i>
<i>You'll get an eyeful</i>

1130
01:14:53,027 --> 01:14:56,130
<i>You want the moon?</i>
<i>I got her, too</i>

1131
01:14:56,163 --> 01:15:01,736
<i>She's right here waiting</i>
<i>In my pay-per-view</i>

1132
01:15:01,769 --> 01:15:03,104
<i>How long's it been?</i>

1133
01:15:03,137 --> 01:15:07,108
<i>A little moonshine</i>
<i>Ain't no sin</i>

1134
01:15:07,141 --> 01:15:10,077
<i>Tell my husband</i>
<i>To take his time</i>

1135
01:15:10,111 --> 01:15:15,916
<i>What the boss don't know</i>
<i>The boss won't mind</i>

1136
01:15:27,094 --> 01:15:28,095
Ha!

1137
01:15:28,129 --> 01:15:30,064
[audience cheering]

1138
01:15:43,177 --> 01:15:45,579
[whistle]

1139
01:15:57,625 --> 01:15:59,994
-The deal is signed.
-Yes.

1140
01:16:00,027 --> 01:16:02,596
-About time.
-Get on the line.

1141
01:16:02,630 --> 01:16:05,132
I did what I had to do.

1142
01:16:05,800 --> 01:16:07,802
That's what they did too.

1143
01:16:07,835 --> 01:16:11,138
<i>Now, in Hadestown</i>
<i>There were a lot of souls</i>

1144
01:16:11,172 --> 01:16:13,808
<i>Oh, keep your head</i>
<i>Keep your head</i>

1145
01:16:13,841 --> 01:16:16,377
<i>Working on the wall</i>
<i>With all their might</i>

1146
01:16:16,410 --> 01:16:19,613
<i>Huh, kkh!</i>
<i>Oh, you gotta keep your head</i>

1147
01:16:19,647 --> 01:16:22,116
<i>Ya see, they kept</i>
<i>Their heads down low</i>

1148
01:16:22,149 --> 01:16:24,885
<i>Huh, kkh!</i>
<i>If you wanna keep your head</i>

1149
01:16:24,919 --> 01:16:27,822
<i>You couldn't quite</i>
<i>See their faces, right</i>

1150
01:16:27,855 --> 01:16:30,224
<i>But you can hear</i>
<i>Them singing</i>

1151
01:16:30,257 --> 01:16:32,993
<i>Oh, keep your head</i>
<i>Keep your head</i>

1152
01:16:33,027 --> 01:16:35,863
<i>Swinging their hammers</i>
<i>In the cold hard ground</i>

1153
01:16:35,896 --> 01:16:38,666
<i>You can hear the sound</i>
<i>Of the pickax ringing</i>

1154
01:16:38,699 --> 01:16:41,135
<i>Huh, kkh!</i>
<i>If you want to keep your head</i>

1155
01:16:41,168 --> 01:16:45,005
<i>And they called it "freedom"</i>

1156
01:16:45,039 --> 01:16:46,807
I'm Eurydice.

1157
01:16:48,142 --> 01:16:49,710
Doesn't anybody hear me?

1158
01:16:49,743 --> 01:16:52,413
-They can hear.
-But they don't care.

1159
01:16:52,446 --> 01:16:55,316
No one has
a name down here.

1160
01:16:55,349 --> 01:16:57,718
<i>Mister Hades set you free</i>

1161
01:16:57,751 --> 01:17:00,754
<i>To work yourself</i>
<i>Into the ground</i>

1162
01:17:00,788 --> 01:17:02,890
<i>Free to spend eternity</i>

1163
01:17:02,923 --> 01:17:05,793
<i>-In the factory</i>
<i>-And the warehouse</i>

1164
01:17:05,826 --> 01:17:07,161
<i>Where the whistles scream</i>

1165
01:17:07,194 --> 01:17:08,729
<i>And the foremen shout</i>

1166
01:17:08,762 --> 01:17:11,232
<i>-And you're punching in</i>
<i>-And punching in</i>

1167
01:17:11,265 --> 01:17:12,800
<i>And punching in</i>

1168
01:17:12,833 --> 01:17:14,768
<i>And you can't punch out</i>

1169
01:17:14,802 --> 01:17:17,404
<i>And you're way down Hadestown</i>

1170
01:17:17,438 --> 01:17:20,107
<i>Way down, Hadestown</i>

1171
01:17:20,141 --> 01:17:23,110
<i>Way down, Hadestown</i>

1172
01:17:23,144 --> 01:17:25,980
<i>Way down under the ground</i>

1173
01:17:26,413 --> 01:17:28,415
Why won't anybody
look at me?

1174
01:17:28,449 --> 01:17:31,051
-They can look.
-But they don't see.

1175
01:17:31,085 --> 01:17:34,188
-You see?
-It's easier that way.

1176
01:17:34,221 --> 01:17:36,757
Your eyes will look
like that someday.

1177
01:17:36,790 --> 01:17:39,727
<i>Down in the river of oblivion</i>

1178
01:17:39,760 --> 01:17:42,463
<i>You kiss your life goodbye</i>

1179
01:17:42,496 --> 01:17:44,765
<i>And Hades laid</i>
<i>His hands on you</i>

1180
01:17:44,798 --> 01:17:47,935
<i>And gave you everlasting life</i>

1181
01:17:47,968 --> 01:17:50,404
<i>And everlasting overtime</i>

1182
01:17:50,437 --> 01:17:51,906
<i>-In the mine</i>
<i>-In the mill</i>

1183
01:17:51,939 --> 01:17:53,307
<i>In the machinery</i>

1184
01:17:53,340 --> 01:17:56,210
<i>Your place</i>
<i>On the assembly line</i>

1185
01:17:56,243 --> 01:17:59,180
<i>Replaces all your memories</i>

1186
01:17:59,213 --> 01:18:02,116
<i>Way down, Hadestown</i>

1187
01:18:02,149 --> 01:18:04,985
<i>Way down, Hadestown</i>

1188
01:18:05,019 --> 01:18:07,388
<i>Way down, Hadestown</i>

1189
01:18:07,421 --> 01:18:10,791
<i>Way down under the ground</i>

1190
01:18:10,824 --> 01:18:13,127
What do you mean
I'll look like that?

1191
01:18:13,160 --> 01:18:15,829
That's what it
looks like to forget.

1192
01:18:15,863 --> 01:18:18,432
-Forget what?
-Who you are.

1193
01:18:18,465 --> 01:18:21,402
And everything that came before.

1194
01:18:21,435 --> 01:18:23,504
-I have to go!
-Go, where?

1195
01:18:23,538 --> 01:18:26,907
-Go back.
-Oh, and where is that?

1196
01:18:26,941 --> 01:18:30,044
So, what was
your name again?

1197
01:18:30,077 --> 01:18:32,413
You've already forgotten.

1198
01:18:33,147 --> 01:18:35,349
You see,
it's like I said before,

1199
01:18:35,382 --> 01:18:38,352
a lot can happen
behind closed doors.

1200
01:18:38,385 --> 01:18:41,021
Eurydice was
a hungry young girl.

1201
01:18:41,055 --> 01:18:43,791
But she wasn't hungry anymore.

1202
01:18:43,824 --> 01:18:47,027
What she was instead was dead.

1203
01:18:47,061 --> 01:18:49,430
Dead to the world anyway.

1204
01:18:49,463 --> 01:18:54,435
You see, she went behind those
doors and signed her life away.

1205
01:18:54,468 --> 01:18:55,769
<i>A-ooh!</i>

1206
01:18:55,803 --> 01:18:59,139
<i>Saw that wheel up in the sky</i>

1207
01:18:59,173 --> 01:19:02,910
<i>-Huh!</i>
<i>-Heard the big bell tolling</i>

1208
01:19:02,943 --> 01:19:04,011
<i>A-ooh!</i>

1209
01:19:04,044 --> 01:19:07,414
<i>A lot of souls have got to die</i>

1210
01:19:07,448 --> 01:19:11,385
<i>To keep the rust belt rolling</i>

1211
01:19:11,418 --> 01:19:15,823
<i>A-ooh!</i>
<i>A lot of spirits gotta break</i>

1212
01:19:15,856 --> 01:19:20,494
<i>To make the Underworld</i>
<i>Go round</i>

1213
01:19:20,528 --> 01:19:25,499
<i>Way down, Hadestown</i>

1214
01:19:25,533 --> 01:19:26,834
Huh!

1215
01:19:26,867 --> 01:19:31,905
<i>Way down under the</i>

1216
01:19:31,939 --> 01:19:36,777
<i>Ground</i>

1217
01:19:58,600 --> 01:20:02,336
<i>What I wanted was</i>
<i>To fall asleep</i>

1218
01:20:03,605 --> 01:20:07,575
<i>Close my eyes and disappear</i>

1219
01:20:09,109 --> 01:20:12,179
<i>Like a petal on a stream</i>

1220
01:20:12,212 --> 01:20:16,283
<i>A feather on the air</i>

1221
01:20:20,622 --> 01:20:21,989
<i>Lily white</i>

1222
01:20:23,023 --> 01:20:25,025
<i>And poppy red</i>

1223
01:20:25,560 --> 01:20:31,432
<i>I trembled</i>
<i>When he laid me out</i>

1224
01:20:31,465 --> 01:20:34,536
<i>"You won't feel a thing"</i>
<i>He said</i>

1225
01:20:34,569 --> 01:20:39,473
<i>"When you go down"</i>

1226
01:20:41,643 --> 01:20:46,347
<i>Nothing gonna wake you now</i>

1227
01:20:49,016 --> 01:20:52,453
<i>Now</i>

1228
01:21:03,364 --> 01:21:06,100
<i>Dreams are sweet</i>

1229
01:21:06,133 --> 01:21:07,468
<i>Until they're not</i>

1230
01:21:09,203 --> 01:21:11,606
<i>Men are kind</i>

1231
01:21:11,639 --> 01:21:14,241
<i>Until they aren't</i>

1232
01:21:14,274 --> 01:21:16,143
<i>Flowers bloom</i>

1233
01:21:16,176 --> 01:21:20,414
<i>Until they rot and fall apart</i>

1234
01:21:26,186 --> 01:21:30,457
<i>Is anybody listening?</i>

1235
01:21:30,491 --> 01:21:36,664
<i>I open my mouth</i>
<i>And nothing comes out</i>

1236
01:21:36,698 --> 01:21:38,700
<i>Nothing</i>

1237
01:21:38,733 --> 01:21:41,669
<i>Nothing gonna wake me</i>

1238
01:21:41,703 --> 01:21:46,340
<i>Now</i>

1239
01:21:52,179 --> 01:21:53,615
[sobbing]

1240
01:21:58,520 --> 01:22:00,220
<i>Flowers</i>

1241
01:22:02,289 --> 01:22:06,661
<i>I remember fields of flowers</i>

1242
01:22:06,694 --> 01:22:10,030
<i>Soft beneath my heels</i>

1243
01:22:10,765 --> 01:22:14,636
<i>Walking in the sun</i>

1244
01:22:14,669 --> 01:22:20,040
<i>I remember someone</i>
<i>Someone by my side</i>

1245
01:22:21,108 --> 01:22:25,145
<i>Turned his face to mine</i>

1246
01:22:25,179 --> 01:22:27,314
<i>And then I turned away</i>

1247
01:22:28,650 --> 01:22:32,587
<i>Into the shade</i>

1248
01:22:36,390 --> 01:22:38,425
[crying softly]

1249
01:22:44,699 --> 01:22:46,133
<i>You</i>

1250
01:22:49,303 --> 01:22:52,306
<i>The one I left behind</i>

1251
01:22:54,208 --> 01:22:56,977
<i>If you ever walk this way</i>

1252
01:22:57,745 --> 01:23:00,347
<i>Come and find me</i>

1253
01:23:00,380 --> 01:23:03,984
<i>Lying in the bed</i>

1254
01:23:04,752 --> 01:23:08,388
<i>I made</i>

1255
01:23:11,124 --> 01:23:13,427
[audience cheering]

1256
01:23:28,710 --> 01:23:30,210
<i>Come home with me</i>

1257
01:23:31,311 --> 01:23:33,046
-It's you.
-It's me.

1258
01:23:33,581 --> 01:23:34,682
<i>Orpheus</i>

1259
01:23:34,716 --> 01:23:36,049
<i>Eurydice</i>

1260
01:23:37,317 --> 01:23:38,586
I called your name before--

1261
01:23:38,620 --> 01:23:40,120
-I know.
You heard?

1262
01:23:40,688 --> 01:23:41,756
No.

1263
01:23:42,222 --> 01:23:44,592
Mister Hermes told me so.

1264
01:23:44,626 --> 01:23:47,127
<i>Whatever happened</i>
<i>I'm to blame</i>

1265
01:23:47,160 --> 01:23:48,161
No, no.

1266
01:23:48,195 --> 01:23:49,463
<i>You called my name</i>

1267
01:23:49,496 --> 01:23:51,231
<i>You came</i>

1268
01:23:51,265 --> 01:23:53,367
But how'd you get here?

1269
01:23:53,400 --> 01:23:55,068
On the train?

1270
01:23:55,837 --> 01:23:59,072
<i>No, I walked a long way</i>

1271
01:23:59,707 --> 01:24:01,475
How'd you get beyond the wall?

1272
01:24:03,243 --> 01:24:06,848
<i>I sang a song so beautiful</i>

1273
01:24:06,881 --> 01:24:09,551
<i>The stones wept</i>
<i>And they let me in</i>

1274
01:24:11,218 --> 01:24:13,453
<i>And I can sing us</i>
<i>Home again</i>

1275
01:24:14,756 --> 01:24:16,356
No, you can't.

1276
01:24:16,390 --> 01:24:17,592
Yes, I can.

1277
01:24:18,358 --> 01:24:20,795
No, you don't understand.

1278
01:24:21,529 --> 01:24:23,430
Young man!

1279
01:24:28,402 --> 01:24:30,470
I don't think we've met before.

1280
01:24:30,504 --> 01:24:32,272
You're not from
around here, son.

1281
01:24:32,306 --> 01:24:34,107
I don't know
who the hell you are

1282
01:24:34,141 --> 01:24:36,176
but I can tell you don't belong.

1283
01:24:36,209 --> 01:24:38,312
These are working people, son.

1284
01:24:38,345 --> 01:24:40,615
Law-abiding citizens.

1285
01:24:40,648 --> 01:24:43,283
Go back to where you came from.

1286
01:24:43,317 --> 01:24:45,385
You're on the wrong side
of the fence.

1287
01:24:45,419 --> 01:24:46,854
Hades, I know this boy.

1288
01:24:46,888 --> 01:24:48,488
One of the unemployed.

1289
01:24:48,523 --> 01:24:50,792
-His name is Orpheus.
-You stay out of this.

1290
01:24:50,825 --> 01:24:53,427
Orpheus was a poor boy.

1291
01:24:53,460 --> 01:24:54,461
Do you hear me, son?

1292
01:24:54,494 --> 01:24:56,430
You might say he was naive.

1293
01:24:56,463 --> 01:24:57,732
You better run!

1294
01:24:57,765 --> 01:25:00,768
This poor boy
raised up his voice

1295
01:25:01,401 --> 01:25:03,470
with his heart
out on his sleeve.

1296
01:25:03,503 --> 01:25:05,138
No, Orpheus, you should go.

1297
01:25:06,239 --> 01:25:08,643
I'm not going back alone.

1298
01:25:08,676 --> 01:25:09,811
I came to take her home.

1299
01:25:12,379 --> 01:25:14,181
[laughs]

1300
01:25:18,853 --> 01:25:21,623
Who the hell
do you think you are?

1301
01:25:21,656 --> 01:25:23,691
Who the hell do you think
you're talking to?

1302
01:25:24,458 --> 01:25:27,461
She couldn't go anywhere
even if she wanted to.

1303
01:25:27,494 --> 01:25:29,764
You are not
from around here, son.

1304
01:25:29,797 --> 01:25:31,799
If you were,
then you would know

1305
01:25:31,833 --> 01:25:36,804
that everything and everyone
in Hadestown, I own!

1306
01:25:38,238 --> 01:25:41,509
But I only buy

1307
01:25:42,644 --> 01:25:44,612
what others choose to sell.

1308
01:25:47,615 --> 01:25:49,483
Oh, you didn't know?

1309
01:25:50,918 --> 01:25:53,453
She signed the deal herself.

1310
01:25:53,921 --> 01:25:55,890
-And now she
-It isn't true.

1311
01:25:55,923 --> 01:25:58,358
-belongs to me.
-It isn't true!

1312
01:25:58,392 --> 01:25:59,560
What he said--

1313
01:25:59,594 --> 01:26:00,928
-Eurydice!
-I did!

1314
01:26:01,796 --> 01:26:03,363
I do.

1315
01:26:03,397 --> 01:26:04,532
As for you...

1316
01:26:05,600 --> 01:26:07,835
Everybody gather round!

1317
01:26:07,869 --> 01:26:09,737
Everybody look and see!

1318
01:26:09,771 --> 01:26:14,642
What becomes of trespassers
with no respect for property.

1319
01:27:24,746 --> 01:27:27,682
<i>Why the struggle?</i>
<i>Why the strain?</i>

1320
01:27:27,715 --> 01:27:31,052
<i>Why make trouble?</i>
<i>Why make scenes?</i>

1321
01:27:31,085 --> 01:27:34,555
<i>Why go against the grain?</i>

1322
01:27:34,589 --> 01:27:39,527
<i>Why swim upstream?</i>

1323
01:27:39,560 --> 01:27:42,063
<i>It ain't, it ain't</i>
<i>It ain't no use</i>

1324
01:27:42,096 --> 01:27:44,331
<i>You're bound, you're bound</i>
<i>You're bound to lose</i>

1325
01:27:44,364 --> 01:27:47,001
<i>What's done, what's done</i>
<i>What's done is done</i>

1326
01:27:47,034 --> 01:27:51,973
<i>That's the way the river runs</i>

1327
01:27:52,006 --> 01:27:56,677
<i>So why get wet?</i>
<i>Why break a sweat?</i>

1328
01:27:56,711 --> 01:27:59,680
<i>Why waste your precious breath?</i>

1329
01:27:59,714 --> 01:28:03,551
<i>Why beat your handsome brow?</i>

1330
01:28:03,584 --> 01:28:07,054
<i>Nothing changes</i>

1331
01:28:07,088 --> 01:28:10,725
<i>Nothing changes</i>

1332
01:28:10,758 --> 01:28:15,395
<i>Nothing changes</i>

1333
01:28:16,130 --> 01:28:21,836
<i>Anyhow</i>

1334
01:28:21,869 --> 01:28:23,838
[audience cheering]

1335
01:28:40,888 --> 01:28:42,890
<i>If it's true what they say</i>

1336
01:28:44,926 --> 01:28:46,894
<i>If there's nothing to be done</i>

1337
01:28:49,130 --> 01:28:51,398
<i>If it's true that it's too late</i>

1338
01:28:53,134 --> 01:28:55,536
<i>And the girl I love is gone</i>

1339
01:28:57,470 --> 01:28:59,106
<i>If it's true what they say</i>

1340
01:29:01,742 --> 01:29:03,343
Is this how the world is?

1341
01:29:06,747 --> 01:29:08,616
<i>To be beaten and betrayed</i>

1342
01:29:08,649 --> 01:29:10,885
<i>And then be told</i>
<i>That nothing changes</i>

1343
01:29:10,918 --> 01:29:13,386
<i>It'll always be like this</i>

1344
01:29:13,955 --> 01:29:16,757
<i>If it's true what they say</i>

1345
01:29:19,492 --> 01:29:24,031
<i>I'll be on my way</i>

1346
01:29:25,099 --> 01:29:26,033
<i>Huh!</i>

1347
01:29:27,535 --> 01:29:29,502
And the boy turned to go.

1348
01:29:29,537 --> 01:29:30,437
<i>Huh!</i>

1349
01:29:31,239 --> 01:29:33,708
'Cos he thought
no one could hear.

1350
01:29:33,741 --> 01:29:34,876
<i>Huh!</i>

1351
01:29:34,909 --> 01:29:36,510
But everybody knows

1352
01:29:36,544 --> 01:29:38,713
that walls have ears.

1353
01:29:38,746 --> 01:29:40,815
<i>-And the workers heard him</i>
<i>-Kkh!</i>

1354
01:29:40,848 --> 01:29:43,117
<i>-If it's true what they say</i>
<i>-Huh!</i>

1355
01:29:43,150 --> 01:29:45,119
<i>-With their hammer swinging</i>
<i>-Kkh!</i>

1356
01:29:45,152 --> 01:29:47,487
<i>-What's the purpose of a man?</i>
<i>-Huh!</i>

1357
01:29:47,521 --> 01:29:49,456
<i>-And they quit their working</i>
<i>-Kkh!</i>

1358
01:29:49,489 --> 01:29:51,626
<i>Just to turn his eyes away</i>

1359
01:29:51,659 --> 01:29:53,761
<i>-When they heard him singing</i>
<i>-Kkh</i>

1360
01:29:53,794 --> 01:29:55,963
<i>Just to throw up</i>
<i>Both his hands</i>

1361
01:29:55,997 --> 01:29:57,965
<i>No hammer swinging</i>

1362
01:29:57,999 --> 01:29:59,867
What's the use
Of his backbone?

1363
01:29:59,901 --> 01:30:02,435
<i>No pickax ring</i>

1364
01:30:02,469 --> 01:30:04,105
<i>If he never stands upright</i>

1365
01:30:04,138 --> 01:30:06,574
<i>And they stood and listened</i>

1366
01:30:06,607 --> 01:30:08,809
<i>If he turns his back</i>
<i>On everyone</i>

1367
01:30:08,843 --> 01:30:10,978
<i>To the poor boy sing</i>

1368
01:30:11,012 --> 01:30:13,147
<i>That he could have</i>
<i>Stood beside</i>

1369
01:30:13,180 --> 01:30:16,117
<i>If it's true what they say</i>

1370
01:30:17,952 --> 01:30:22,489
<i>I'll be on my way</i>

1371
01:30:24,525 --> 01:30:27,895
<i>But who are they to say</i>

1372
01:30:27,929 --> 01:30:29,797
<i>What the truth is anyway?</i>

1373
01:30:31,165 --> 01:30:33,567
<i>Ask the ones</i>
<i>Who tell the lies</i>

1374
01:30:33,601 --> 01:30:35,002
<i>Ahh</i>

1375
01:30:35,036 --> 01:30:37,571
<i>Are the solemnest to swear</i>

1376
01:30:39,707 --> 01:30:41,943
<i>And the ones</i>
<i>Who load the dice</i>

1377
01:30:41,976 --> 01:30:43,177
<i>Hmm</i>

1378
01:30:43,210 --> 01:30:46,446
<i>Always say the toss is fair</i>

1379
01:30:47,782 --> 01:30:50,117
<i>And the ones</i>
<i>Who deal the cards</i>

1380
01:30:50,151 --> 01:30:51,686
<i>Deal the cards</i>

1381
01:30:51,719 --> 01:30:53,754
<i>Are the ones</i>
<i>Who take the tricks</i>

1382
01:30:53,788 --> 01:30:55,488
<i>Ahh</i>

1383
01:30:55,990 --> 01:30:58,759
<i>With their hands</i>
<i>Over their hearts</i>

1384
01:30:58,793 --> 01:30:59,961
<i>Mmmm</i>

1385
01:30:59,994 --> 01:31:04,198
<i>While we play the game they fix</i>

1386
01:31:04,231 --> 01:31:06,200
<i>And the ones</i>
<i>Who speak the word</i>

1387
01:31:06,233 --> 01:31:07,969
<i>Speak the word</i>

1388
01:31:08,002 --> 01:31:10,838
<i>Always say it is the last</i>

1389
01:31:10,871 --> 01:31:12,239
<i>Mmmm</i>

1390
01:31:12,273 --> 01:31:15,676
<i>And no answer</i>
<i>Will be heard</i>

1391
01:31:16,811 --> 01:31:19,814
<i>To the question no one asks</i>

1392
01:31:19,847 --> 01:31:21,816
<i>So I'm asking if it's true!</i>

1393
01:31:24,085 --> 01:31:25,953
<i>I'm asking me and you</i>

1394
01:31:25,987 --> 01:31:27,922
<i>And you</i>
<i>And you</i>

1395
01:31:27,955 --> 01:31:30,024
<i>I believe our answer matters</i>

1396
01:31:30,057 --> 01:31:32,026
<i>More than anything they say</i>

1397
01:31:32,059 --> 01:31:34,061
<i>We stand and listen</i>

1398
01:31:34,095 --> 01:31:36,163
<i>We stand</i>

1399
01:31:36,197 --> 01:31:38,165
<i>I believe if there is</i>
<i>Still a will</i>

1400
01:31:38,199 --> 01:31:40,167
<i>Then there is still a way</i>

1401
01:31:40,201 --> 01:31:42,536
<i>We're standing with him</i>

1402
01:31:42,570 --> 01:31:44,538
<i>I believe there is a way</i>

1403
01:31:44,572 --> 01:31:48,576
<i>I believe in us together</i>
<i>More than anyone alone</i>

1404
01:31:48,609 --> 01:31:50,678
<i>We're standing near him</i>

1405
01:31:50,711 --> 01:31:52,813
<i>Near him</i>

1406
01:31:52,847 --> 01:31:54,815
<i>I believe that with each other</i>

1407
01:31:54,849 --> 01:31:56,817
<i>We are stronger than we know</i>

1408
01:31:56,851 --> 01:31:58,285
<i>We hear him</i>

1409
01:31:58,319 --> 01:32:01,088
<i>I believe we're stronger</i>
<i>Than they know</i>

1410
01:32:01,122 --> 01:32:03,257
<i>I believe that we are many</i>

1411
01:32:03,290 --> 01:32:05,026
<i>I believe that they are few</i>

1412
01:32:05,059 --> 01:32:09,230
<i>-We're standin'</i>
<i>-We're standin'</i>

1413
01:32:09,263 --> 01:32:11,332
<i>And it isn't for the few</i>

1414
01:32:11,365 --> 01:32:13,234
<i>To tell the many what is true</i>

1415
01:32:13,267 --> 01:32:15,636
<i>We understand him</i>

1416
01:32:15,669 --> 01:32:17,605
<i>So I ask you</i>

1417
01:32:17,638 --> 01:32:19,940
<i>If it's true what they say</i>

1418
01:32:19,974 --> 01:32:21,575
<i>Standin'</i>

1419
01:32:21,609 --> 01:32:24,011
<i>I'll be on my way</i>

1420
01:32:24,045 --> 01:32:25,246
<i>Standin'</i>

1421
01:32:25,279 --> 01:32:27,882
<i>Tell me what to do?</i>

1422
01:32:27,915 --> 01:32:29,950
<i>Standin'</i>

1423
01:32:29,984 --> 01:32:31,052
<i>Is it true?</i>

1424
01:32:32,119 --> 01:32:37,658
<i>Is it true what they say?</i>

1425
01:32:39,093 --> 01:32:41,629
[audience cheering]

1426
01:33:01,182 --> 01:33:02,650
What are you afraid of?

1427
01:33:03,250 --> 01:33:04,151
What?

1428
01:33:04,185 --> 01:33:07,121
He's just a boy in love.

1429
01:33:07,154 --> 01:33:08,889
Have a drink, why don't you?

1430
01:33:08,923 --> 01:33:10,591
No, I've had enough.

1431
01:33:12,426 --> 01:33:14,328
He loves that girl, Hades.

1432
01:33:14,361 --> 01:33:16,197
Well, that's too bad.

1433
01:33:16,230 --> 01:33:20,835
He has the kind of love for her
that you and I once had.

1434
01:33:22,203 --> 01:33:24,138
The girl means nothing to me.

1435
01:33:25,005 --> 01:33:29,176
I know, but she means
everything to him.

1436
01:33:29,210 --> 01:33:30,077
So?

1437
01:33:30,878 --> 01:33:31,912
Let her go.

1438
01:33:34,115 --> 01:33:37,251
<i>Hades, my husband</i>

1439
01:33:37,284 --> 01:33:40,354
<i>Hades, my light</i>

1440
01:33:40,387 --> 01:33:45,059
<i>Hades, my darkness</i>

1441
01:33:46,026 --> 01:33:50,064
<i>If you had heard</i>
<i>How he sang tonight</i>

1442
01:33:51,332 --> 01:33:56,670
<i>You'd pity poor Orpheus</i>

1443
01:33:56,704 --> 01:34:01,675
<i>All of his sorrow</i>
<i>Won't fit in his chest</i>

1444
01:34:01,709 --> 01:34:06,447
<i>It just burns like a fire</i>
<i>In the pit of his chest</i>

1445
01:34:06,480 --> 01:34:11,852
<i>And his heart is a bird</i>
<i>On a spit in his chest</i>

1446
01:34:11,886 --> 01:34:16,023
<i>How long</i>
<i>How long, how long</i>

1447
01:34:16,824 --> 01:34:18,058
<i>How long?</i>

1448
01:34:18,092 --> 01:34:21,630
<i>Just as long</i>
<i>As Hades is King</i>

1449
01:34:23,264 --> 01:34:28,736
<i>Nothing comes</i>
<i>Of wishing on stars</i>

1450
01:34:28,769 --> 01:34:33,941
<i>And nothing comes</i>
<i>Of the songs people sing</i>

1451
01:34:35,075 --> 01:34:39,113
<i>However sorry they are</i>

1452
01:34:39,914 --> 01:34:45,252
<i>Give them a piece</i>
<i>And they'll take it all</i>

1453
01:34:45,286 --> 01:34:50,090
<i>Show them a crack</i>
<i>They'll tear down the wall</i>

1454
01:34:50,124 --> 01:34:54,762
<i>Lend them an ear</i>
<i>And the kingdom will fall</i>

1455
01:34:55,229 --> 01:34:59,033
<i>The kingdom will fall</i>
<i>For a song</i>

1456
01:34:59,934 --> 01:35:05,873
<i>What does he care</i>
<i>For the logic of kings?</i>

1457
01:35:05,906 --> 01:35:11,245
<i>The laws of your Underworld</i>

1458
01:35:12,012 --> 01:35:17,218
<i>It is only for love</i>
<i>That he sings</i>

1459
01:35:17,251 --> 01:35:22,389
<i>He sings</i>
<i>For the love of a girl</i>

1460
01:35:22,423 --> 01:35:27,127
<i>You and your pity</i>
<i>Don't fit in my bed</i>

1461
01:35:27,161 --> 01:35:31,932
<i>You just burn like a fire</i>
<i>In the pit of my bed</i>

1462
01:35:31,966 --> 01:35:37,271
<i>And I turn like a bird</i>
<i>On a spit in my bed</i>

1463
01:35:37,304 --> 01:35:42,276
<i>How long</i>
<i>How long, how long?</i>

1464
01:35:42,309 --> 01:35:43,844
<i>How long?</i>

1465
01:35:43,877 --> 01:35:46,947
<i>Just as long</i>
<i>As I am your wife</i>

1466
01:35:48,449 --> 01:35:54,455
<i>It's true</i>
<i>The earth must die</i>

1467
01:35:54,488 --> 01:35:59,561
<i>But then the earth</i>
<i>Comes back to life</i>

1468
01:35:59,594 --> 01:36:05,533
<i>And the sun</i>
<i>Must go on rising</i>

1469
01:36:05,567 --> 01:36:10,404
<i>And how does the sun</i>
<i>Even fit in the sky?</i>

1470
01:36:10,437 --> 01:36:15,976
<i>It just burns like a fire</i>
<i>In the pit of the sky</i>

1471
01:36:16,010 --> 01:36:21,248
<i>And the earth is a bird</i>
<i>On a spit in the sky</i>

1472
01:36:21,282 --> 01:36:25,185
<i>How long, how long</i>

1473
01:36:25,219 --> 01:36:30,124
<i>How long?</i>

1474
01:36:30,157 --> 01:36:33,060
[audience cheering]

1475
01:36:39,933 --> 01:36:42,836
Now everybody knows
that walls have ears.

1476
01:36:42,870 --> 01:36:44,505
<i>-Is it true?</i>
<i>-Is it true?</i>

1477
01:36:44,539 --> 01:36:47,542
What's that noise?

1478
01:36:47,575 --> 01:36:50,444
And the walls had heard
what the boy was sayin'.

1479
01:36:50,477 --> 01:36:53,013
<i>-Is it true?</i>
<i>-Is it true?</i>

1480
01:36:53,047 --> 01:36:54,415
It's the boy.

1481
01:36:55,349 --> 01:36:58,419
<i>A million tons</i>
<i>Of stone and steel</i>

1482
01:36:58,452 --> 01:37:00,921
<i>-Is it true?</i>
<i>-Is it true?</i>

1483
01:37:00,954 --> 01:37:03,257
<i>Echoed his refrain</i>

1484
01:37:03,290 --> 01:37:05,292
[steam whistle blows]

1485
01:37:08,228 --> 01:37:12,066
<i>Oh, keep your head</i>
<i>Keep your head low, kkh!</i>

1486
01:37:12,099 --> 01:37:14,569
<i>Oh, you gotta keep</i>
<i>Your head low, kkh!</i>

1487
01:37:14,602 --> 01:37:17,171
<i>If you wanna keep your head</i>
<i>Huh, kkh!</i>

1488
01:37:17,204 --> 01:37:19,641
<i>Oh, you gotta keep</i>
<i>Your head low</i>

1489
01:37:19,674 --> 01:37:22,142
<i>Keep your head</i>
<i>Keep your head low</i>

1490
01:37:22,176 --> 01:37:24,945
<i>Oh, you gotta</i>
<i>Keep your head low, kkh!</i>

1491
01:37:24,978 --> 01:37:28,382
<i>If you wanna keep your head</i>
<i>Huh, kkh! Oh, you gotta--</i>

1492
01:37:28,415 --> 01:37:31,619
<i>Why do we turn away</i>
<i>When our brother is bleeding?</i>

1493
01:37:31,653 --> 01:37:33,454
<i>Oh, keep your head</i>

1494
01:37:33,487 --> 01:37:36,457
<i>Why do we build a wall</i>
<i>And then call it freedom?</i>

1495
01:37:36,490 --> 01:37:38,292
<i>Oh, keep your head</i>

1496
01:37:38,325 --> 01:37:39,460
<i>If we're free</i>

1497
01:37:39,493 --> 01:37:41,061
<i>Tell me why</i>

1498
01:37:41,095 --> 01:37:43,330
<i>I can't look</i>
<i>In my brother's eye</i>

1499
01:37:43,364 --> 01:37:45,032
<i>-Keep your head--</i>
<i>-Young man!</i>

1500
01:37:45,065 --> 01:37:46,433
<i>Got to hand it to ya</i>

1501
01:37:46,467 --> 01:37:49,036
<i>Guess you don't scare easy</i>
<i>Do ya?</i>

1502
01:37:49,069 --> 01:37:51,472
<i>Are you brave or stupid, son?</i>

1503
01:37:51,505 --> 01:37:53,073
<i>Doesn't matter which one</i>

1504
01:37:53,107 --> 01:37:55,075
<i>'Cos it seems your song made</i>

1505
01:37:55,109 --> 01:37:58,011
<i>Quite a strong impression</i>
<i>On my wife</i>

1506
01:37:58,045 --> 01:38:00,648
<i>But it takes more</i>
<i>Than singing songs</i>

1507
01:38:00,682 --> 01:38:02,550
<i>To keep a woman in your arms</i>

1508
01:38:03,150 --> 01:38:05,653
<i>Take it from a man</i>
<i>No longer young</i>

1509
01:38:05,687 --> 01:38:08,355
<i>If you want</i>
<i>To hold a woman, son</i>

1510
01:38:08,389 --> 01:38:10,958
<i>Hang a chain</i>
<i>Around her throat</i>

1511
01:38:10,991 --> 01:38:13,394
<i>Made of many karat gold</i>

1512
01:38:13,427 --> 01:38:15,630
<i>Shackle her</i>
<i>From wrist to wrist</i>

1513
01:38:15,663 --> 01:38:18,065
<i>With sterling silver bracelets</i>

1514
01:38:18,098 --> 01:38:21,034
<i>Fill her pockets full of stones</i>

1515
